{\Huge\bfseries Get started}\\[14pt]
\begin{lstlisting}[backgroundcolor=\color{white!95!navy},basicstyle=\ttfamily\scriptsize\color{navy}]
git clone https://github.com/Gokaran-Shukla/hopforge
cd hopforge && pip install -e ".[notebooks,test]"
pytest -q
python -m hopforge.benchmarks -j -1
jupyter lab tutorials/
\end{lstlisting}
